`rate is high` and `TRUE`
`TRUE` and `rate is high`
not `rate is low` or `FALSE`
not `FALSE` or `rate is low`
`rate is low` implies `FALSE`
`TRUE` implies `rate is high`
not `rate is low`
`combine` with `__AND__`, `rate is high` and `TRUE`
`combine` with `__AND__`, `TRUE` and `rate is high`
not `combine` with `__OR__`, `rate is low` and `FALSE`
not `combine` with `__OR__`, `FALSE` and `rate is low`
`combine` with `__IMPLIES__`, `rate is low` and `FALSE`
`combine` with `__IMPLIES__`, `TRUE` and `rate is high`
`apply` with `__NOT__` and `rate is low`
